name wordframenet-xwfn
# XWFN/eXtendedWFN: Extended WordFrameNet frame alignments to WordNet words, parts of speech, and synset offsets.
match eXtendedWFN
witness eXtendedWFN
lineage WordFrameNet
class AcademicCurated
tier block by \n\n
names frame row...
tier line by \n
part frame by space pieces 2
content frame row
thing block frame/2
attest block row
value - row
